    "interpretation": "The nonphysical negative-density result was caused by forcing all light ions through one loss operator. Every Ar-containing condition is compatible with nonnegative sources and a modest positive CF3+-selective removal term. Pure C4F6 changes sign across the Te grid, proving that one fixed loss factor is still not a complete reactor model.",
